  "description": "The Teammachine SLR THREE shares the same Advanced Carbon frame that defines the SLR platform, delivering a road bike built to defy gravity with efficiency, stability, and precision, in a package that’s more accessible.\nRefined over more than a decade, this iteration continues to raise the standard for stiffness-to-weight performance, making for ultra-efficient power transfer on the climbs and responsive handling on the way back down.\nAs the introduction to our flagship climbing bike range, it also carries the full suite of BMC design intelligence: TCC Race compliance construction, our signature D-shape carbon seatpost, ensuring comfort doesn’t come at the cost of control. The ride stays composed when surfaces deteriorate and direct when precision matters most.\nEquipped with Shimano 105 groupset and finished with our RSM01 stem, alloy bars, and dependable PRD23 wheels, the Teammachine SLR THREE keeps your focus on the road ahead and the climb you’re already committed to.",
